      "id": 1,
      "text": "Governor Benning Wentworth chartered Pownal on January 28, 1760, naming it after Thomas Pownall of the Province of Massachusetts Bay.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
